|CKBCharlatan|000

|CK0Charlatans are tricksters who weaponize misdirection, unstable chemistry,
contraband, prepared surprises, and confidence. Their victories often begin
with the enemy believing the wrong thing at exactly the wrong time.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0Combat earns Charlatan Rank and guild XP. Rank grants road points for
Misdirection, Volatility, and Contraband; higher ranks unlock Schemes that can
be slotted as active cloak notes. Alchemy, Herbalism, and Smithing remain real
professions that support the guild's technical tricks.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0confuse creates an opening, suckerpunch exploits it, distract and
pocketsand control a foe, brewacid and brewelement create unstable mixtures,
loadweapon and stretchpoison prepare contraband, and concoct or cookash turn
questionable materials into useful results.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Charlatan if you enjoy setup, control, crafting support, horizontal
build choices, and a toolkit with several indirect answers instead of a single
clean combat identity.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBcharlhelp commands|CK0, |CKBchskills|CK0,
|CKBcroads|CK0, and |CKBschemes|CK0 to inspect the full confidence game.|000

